A \e[38;2;129;162;190mlabel with \e[1mnested emphasis\e[0m\e[0m\e[38;2;150;152;150m (https://example.test/label)\e[0m, a bare secure URL \e[38;2;129;162;190mhttps://example.test/bare\e[0m, a bare ordinary URL \e[38;2;129;162;190mhttp://example.test/plain\e[0m, and a www URL \e[38;2;129;162;190mhttp://www.example.test/path\e[0m.

This \e[38;2;129;162;190mlong linked label crosses narrow rows without leaking into its neighbours\e[0m\e[38;2;150;152;150m (https://example.test/a-long-destination?first=one&second=two)\e[0m, while \e[38;2;129;162;190mmixed-case HTTPS\e[0m\e[38;2;150;152;150m (HTTPS://example.test/case)\e[0m is accepted too.

Unsupported \e[38;2;129;162;190mscript links\e[0m\e[38;2;150;152;150m (javascript:alert(1))\e[0m, \e[38;2;129;162;190mrelative links\e[0m\e[38;2;150;152;150m (docs/page.md)\e[0m, \e[38;2;129;162;190mhostless links\e[0m\e[38;2;150;152;150m (https:path)\e[0m, and FTP \e[38;2;129;162;190mftp://example.test/archive\e[0m remain visible but inert.

